Description:

As theorized by bugman; http://www.fractalforums.com/index.php?topic=2062.msg9019
This is the non-trigonometric power 7 mandelbulb, cosine variation.

  a = load1() + Cns[2]/r6*(z6-Cns[4]*z4*r2+Cns[3]*z2*r4);
  // -------------------
  px *= (-a)*(x6+Cns[0]*x4*y2 +Cns[1]*x2*y4+Cns[2]*y6);
  py *= a*(y6+Cns[0]*y4*x2 +Cns[1]*y2*x4+Cns[2]*x6);
  pz *= z6 + Cns[2]*r2*(Cns[3]*z4-Cns[4]*z2*r2+r4);
  // add c and return
  px = px + cfg->Cx;
  py = py + cfg->Cy;
  pz = pz + cfg->Cz;